#: org.kde.inotify-survey.metainfo.xml:10
msgid "inotify Survey"
msgstr "Pregled inotifyja"

#. (itstool) path: component/summary
#: org.kde.inotify-survey.metainfo.xml:11
msgid "Surveys inotify state of the system"
msgstr "Prati stanje inotifyja u sustavu"

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.inotify-survey.metainfo.xml:13
msgid "Have you ever wondered why Dolphin or any other application stopped noticing file changes? Chances are you ran out of inotify resources. kde-inotify-survey to the rescue! Sporting a KDED module to tell you when things are getting dicey and a CLI tool to inspect the state of affairs."
msgstr "Jeste li se ikad zapitali zašto Dolphin ili neka druga aplikacija više ne primjećuje promjene datoteka? Vjerojatno su vam ponestali resursi inotifyja. U pomoć stiže kde-inotify-survey! Sadrži modul KDED koji vas upozorava kad situacija postane kritična te alat naredbenog retka za pregled stanja."

